-df-epsilon-nfa-notation]]、[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-acceptance-notation]]。"},{"id":"c94730370dfe9091","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"69901fc0f2bc2a70","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\equiv_L,\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)$ 见 [[73-df-nerode-quotient-notation]]；$\\mathrm{DFA},L(M),\\mathrm{REGULAR}$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["6d26348026d8f259","ccb4038df32f3b1f","3b7a967565c86f39","0a6da8c909717780"]}